      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "AAAAH\nThis just drove me insane all night long, easy fix is just to move your Animator up one level from the Pickup script object. No idea why Animation Sync is forced on all Pickup/VRC_Sync objects, if they have an Animator on them. Taking the Animator off and animating them from one level up works fine though! (Can just Create Empty and nest your pickups that way too)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
