  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-29T04:24:38.327Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Pickup objects without object sync/animation sync but with an animator will still have animations synced. Master can change the animations for the entire room but no one else can change them. \n\nWorld with example of the bug. Contains a local pickup with a animator that changes the material of the pickup. There is a button with local on interact to change the color. Everyone in the room sees the same color box.\n\nwrld_ed4bb73b-9174-452b-b59a-c73b4f3e3735\n\nhttps://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/466825988509138944/506321795377266690/Local_Pickup_Sync_Test.unitypackage",
